<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/media-literacy> <https://glossarystudio.app/ns/editorialExplanation> "Distinguishes critical engagement with media messages from digital-tool competence." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/media-literacy/versions/1> .
<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/media-literacy> <https://glossarystudio.app/ns/fieldCollection> <https://id.i2idl.org/collections/field/education> <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/media-literacy/versions/1> .
